		"description": "<p>When you switch Elemental Attunements, you unleash a burst of power based on the element you are newly attuning to. These effects only happen in initiative.</p><p>To Fire: Enemies in Burst 1 of you take KEY Fire damage &amp; gain Smoldering.</p><p>To Water: Enemies in Burst 1 of you are Slowed and allies regain KEY HP.</p><p>To Air: 1 enemy in Range 12 takes 2xKEY Lightning damage. You become Charged.</p><p>To Earth: Large or smaller enemies in Burst 1 of you are pushed 1 space from you.</p>",
